{
  "info": {
    "name": "E-Commerce Platform (VoltStack)",
    "description": "Flow test chính: Auth → Thêm giỏ hàng → Checkout (ra QR VNPay) → VNPay callback → Payment events → Email.\n\n## Cách dùng\n1. Khởi động stack: Eureka (8761/8762) → Config (8888) → Kafka → Redis → Postgres → các service → ApiGateway (8080).\n2. **Login** lấy token (test script tự lưu `accessToken`). Register tạo account CUSTOMER trước.\n3. **Seed kho**: POST `/api/v1/inventory/import` với SKU có thật trong Product-Catalog (đủ để checkout reserve).\n4. Thêm SKU vào giỏ → **Checkout** → response có `data.qrImage` (PNG data URI) + `data.paymentUrl` (hosted VNPay).\n5. Mở **VNPay Return (simulate)** trong folder Payment — điền `txnRef`/`amount` từ đơn vừa tạo; pre-request script tự tính `vnp_SecureHash` bằng `vnpayHashSecret` (phải khớp `VNPAY_SECRET` của Payment-Service).\n6. Kiểm tra: GET `/api/v1/payments/history` đổi trạng thái, Notification log ra email payment-confirmed.\n\n⚠️ **Admin endpoints** (inventory, order admin, product create) cần role `ORDER_ADMIN`/`SUPER_ADMIN`/`PRODUCT_ADMIN` — register luôn tạo CUSTOMER, phải gán role trong DB trước khi test.\n⚠️ **Không đặt credentials thật** — VNPAY_TMN_CODE/VNPAY_SECRET để trống thì sandbox gateway fallback hosted page bình thường.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sku", "value": "SKU-001" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "txnRef", "value": "" },
    { "key": "amountVnd", "value": "10000" },
    { "key": "vnpayTmnCode", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vnpayHashSecret", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "description": "Register tạo tài khoản (luôn CUSTOMER). Login tự lưu accessToken + refreshToken vào collection variable.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Nguyen Van A\",\n  \"phone\": \"0900000000\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Products & Categories",
      "description": "GET public. POST/PUT/DELETE cần role PRODUCT_ADMIN (gán trong DB).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=0&size=10", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "products"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "10" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get product by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{id}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "products", "{id}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create product (multipart, admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "products"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "Ao thun nam", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Ao thun cotton 100%", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "<category-id>", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "brand", "value": "VoltStack", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "variants", "value": "[{\"sku\":\"SKU-001\",\"name\":\"Do\",\"price\":199000,\"images\":[]}]", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "image", "value": "", "type": "file", "src": "" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "categories"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create category (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "categories"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Thoi trang nam\",\n  \"slug\": \"thoi-trang-nam\",\n  \"parentId\": null\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Cart",
      "description": "Guest dùng header `X-Session-Id` (vd: `guest-abc123`) — đặt collection variable `sessionId`. User đã login thì bỏ qua X-Session-Id (cart theo userId).",
      "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Session-Id", "value": "{{sessionId}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cart"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Session-Id", "value": "{{sessionId}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cart", "items"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update item quantity",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Session-Id", "value": "{{sessionId}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/{sku}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cart", "items", "{sku}"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Session-Id", "value": "{{sessionId}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/{sku}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cart", "items", "{sku}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Merge guest cart to user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Session-Id", "value": "{{sessionId}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/merge", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cart", "merge"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Checkout (VNPay QR)",
      "description": "POST /orders: body bắt buộc {shippingAddress, paymentMethod, email}. Header `Idempotency-Key` optional.\nResponse `data.qrImage` = PNG data URI VNPay NAPAS QR (show màn hình 'quét mã QR'); `data.paymentUrl` = hosted VNPay page fallback.\nTest script tự lưu `orderId`, `txnRef` (data.transactionId), `amountVnd` (totalAmount × 100) để dùng cho VNPay callback bên dưới.",
      "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create order (checkout)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shippingAddress\": \"123 Le Loi, Q1, TP.HCM\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"VNPAY\",\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', d.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('txnRef', d.transactionId);",
                  "const total = Number(d.totalAmount);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('amountVnd', String(Math.round(total * 100)));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List my orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=10", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "10" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get order detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{id}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{id}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Order history",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{id}/history", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{id}", "history"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{id}/cancel", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{id}", "cancel"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: list all orders",
          "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/admin", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "admin"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin: update order status",
          "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{id}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{id}", "status"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\",\n  \"reason\": \"Thanh toan da duoc xac nhan\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Inventory (admin)",
      "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Import stock (seed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/import", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "inventory", "import"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 100,\n  \"reference\": \"seed-batch\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List stock",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory?page=0&size=20", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "inventory"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "20" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get stock by sku",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{sku}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "inventory", "{sku}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Stock transactions by sku",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{sku}/transactions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "inventory", "{sku}", "transactions"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Payment — VNPay",
      "description": "**Return URL + IPN** là public (không cần Bearer). Pre-request script tự tính `vnp_SecureHash` (cùng rule VnPayCrypto: sorted key=value, giá trị URL-encode form-style, HMAC-SHA512 hex).\n\nĐiền trước khi chạy:\n- `vnpayTmnCode`, `vnpayHashSecret` — khớp `VNPAY_TMN_CODE` / `VNPAY_SECRET` của Payment-Service.\n- `txnRef`, `amountVnd` — từ checkout (test script đã tự lưu). `vnp_Amount` = tổng tiền × 100.\n\nSau khi chạy: đơn thành CONFIRMED (Order consume `payment.events`), Notification gửi email `payment-confirmed`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Payment history (mine)",
          "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/history?page=0&size=20", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "history"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "20" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "VNPay Return (simulate browser redirect)",
          "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/vnpay/return", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "payments", "vnpay", "return"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Same rule as Payment VnPayCrypto: sorted key=value, values URL-encoded (space->+), HMAC-SHA512 hex.",
                  "const params = {",
                  "  vnp_Amount: pm.variables.get('amountVnd'),",
                  "  vnp_OrderInfo: 'Thanh toan don hang ' + pm.variables.get('txnRef'),",
                  "  vnp_ResponseCode: '00',",
                  "  vnp_TmnCode: pm.variables.get('vnpayTmnCode'),",
                  "  vnp_TransactionStatus: '00',",
                  "  vnp_TxnRef: pm.variables.get('txnRef')",
                  "};",
                  "const secret = pm.variables.get('vnpayHashSecret');",
                  "const canon = Object.keys(params).sort()",
                  "  .map(k => k + '=' + encodeURIComponent(params[k]).replace(/%20/g, '+')).join('&');",
                  "params.vnp_SecureHash = CryptoJS.HmacSHA512(canon, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "const q = Object.keys(params).sort().map(k => encodeURIComponent(k) + '=' + encodeURIComponent(params[k])).join('&');",
                  "pm.request.url = pm.variables.get('baseUrl') + '/api/v1/payments/vnpay/return?' + q;"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "VNPay IPN (server-to-server)",
          "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/vnpay/ipn", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["webhooks", "vnpay", "ipn"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Same rule as Payment VnPayCrypto: sorted key=value, values URL-encoded (space->+), HMAC-SHA512 hex.",
                  "const params = {",
                  "  vnp_Amount: pm.variables.get('amountVnd'),",
                  "  vnp_BankCode: 'VNPAYQR',",
                  "  vnp_CardType: 'QR',",
                  "  vnp_OrderInfo: 'Thanh toan don hang ' + pm.variables.get('txnRef'),",
                  "  vnp_PayDate: '20260823120000',",
                  "  vnp_ResponseCode: '00',",
                  "  vnp_TmnCode: pm.variables.get('vnpayTmnCode'),",
                  "  vnp_TransactionNo: 'VNPAY12345',",
                  "  vnp_TransactionStatus: '00',",
                  "  vnp_TxnRef: pm.variables.get('txnRef')",
                  "};",
                  "const secret = pm.variables.get('vnpayHashSecret');",
                  "const canon = Object.keys(params).sort()",
                  "  .map(k => k + '=' + encodeURIComponent(params[k]).replace(/%20/g, '+')).join('&');",
                  "params.vnp_SecureHash = CryptoJS.HmacSHA512(canon, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "const q = Object.keys(params).sort().map(k => encodeURIComponent(k) + '=' + encodeURIComponent(params[k])).join('&');",
                  "pm.request.url = pm.variables.get('baseUrl') + '/webhooks/vnpay/ipn?' + q;"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Actuator health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["actuator", "health"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
